{"id":"eed622a1df","t":"Nightwatcher","c":"cv","n":44,"l":44,"s":["mg","ml"],"k":{"mg":"nightwatcher","ml":"nightwatcher"},"u":1795728716709,"desc":"في هذا العالم، تجتمع مسالك الحكمة، ودروب الطاو، و البوذيين، وبطش الأرواح البرية، وخفايا الفنون السحرية! استيقظ شو تشيان بعد انتقاله عبر العوالم ليجد نفسه قابعًا خلف القضبان، وتنتظره عقوبة النفي إلى الحدود بعد ثلاثة أيام؟! كان جل أمله في البداية حماية نفسه وأن يغدو ثريًا يقضي أيامه بعزٍ وهناء في هذا العالم، ولكن...","type":"مانها","status":"مستمر","genres":["أكشن","صقل","غموض","شونين","دراما","فانتازيا","تاريخي","كوميديا"],"src":{"mg":"nightwatcher","ml":"nightwatcher"},"chapters":{"1":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/1/"},"2":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/2/"},"3":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/3/"},"4":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/4/"},"5":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/5/"},"6":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/6/"},"7":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/7/"},"8":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/8/"},"9":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/9/"},"10":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/10/"},"11":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/11/"},"12":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/12/"},"13":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/13/"},"14":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/14/"},"15":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/15/"},"16":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/16_3/"},"17":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/17_3/"},"18":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/18_3/"},"19":{"mg":"nightwatcher|","ml":"nightwatcher|/manga/nightwatcher/19/"},"20":{"mg